<?php require 'includes/functions.php';$title='Our story';require 'includes/header.php';?><section class="hero about-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">WHY MEALBRIDGE EXISTS</div><h1>Food is better<br>when it is <em>shared.</em></h1><p>Surplus food and empty plates should not exist side by side. MealBridge helps individuals, restaurants and caterers connect with orphanages in their community.</p><a class="button" href="<?=url('register.php')?>">Be part of the story <?=icon('arrow')?></a></div><img src="<?=url('assets/images/hero.svg')?>" alt="Fresh ingredients on a shared plate"></section><section class="section"><div class="steps"><article><span><?=icon('leaf')?></span><h3>Less food wasted</h3><p>Share surplus food while it can still be enjoyed.</p></article><article><span><?=icon('heart')?></span><h3>More local connection</h3><p>Approved accounts help donors and orphanages coordinate confidently.</p></article><article><span><?=icon('box')?></span><h3>A clear journey</h3><p>Follow each donation from availability to acceptance and collection.</p></article></div><div class="panel"><h2>Sharing responsibly</h2><p>Donors provide preparation, storage and allergen information. Orphanages arrange transport, check food suitability and confirm receipt. Account approval does not certify food safety: both parties should communicate before pickup.</p></div></section><?php require 'includes/footer.php';?>